#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Cinema - Films" tvg-id="2027620380" tvg-name="In a small town in northern Norway‚ Eira tries to walk in the shoes of her brilliant and rebellious older sister Vera. Lately however‚ something is happening to Vera.In a bid to understand‚ Eira starts reading her diary and enters Vera's universe of light‚ glitter‚ mythology and hopes for a more beautiful world. Her diary reveals a darkness that leaves Eira confused.<br/>From 08.01.2024 00:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Sister‚ What Grows Where Land Is Sick? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (08.01.2024)
