#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Ideas" tvg-id="1373442704" tvg-name="The pandemic saw us press pause on consumption and carbon emissions‚ and many ecologists celebrated the fact that the planet was being given a much-needed break.Raphaël Enthoven talks with the philosopher Dominique Bourg and the journalist Ferghane Azihari about being green in the modern world.<br/>From 14.04.2022 07:01" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Philosophy - Ecology: The Enemy of Progress? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (14.04.2022)
