#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="1039626211" tvg-name="At the front‚ the war continues‚ but for Ukrainians‚ the process of remembering has already begun. How can the country honour its many dead while conflict endures? In this episode‚ Tracks East looks at the way in which men and women evoke the past and perpetuate its memory.<br/>From 17.10.2023 14:47" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - The Dead Don't Die: Never Forgetting (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (17.10.2023)
