#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="630749323" tvg-name="Since the wars that devastated the Balkans in the 1990s‚ the international community has continued to associate Southeastern Europe with a powder keg. Tracks East has therefore chosen to give a voice to young artists from Bosnia and Herzegovina‚ Serbia‚ and Kosovo who strive to portray a different image of this region of the world.<br/>From 30.05.2023 09:52" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - The Millennials of the Balkans (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (30.05.2023)
