#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="2073051231" tvg-name="Should artists and musicians be active cultural warriors in the war in Ukraine? Or should art provide solace from the brutality of war? Tracks East focuses on artists from countries devastated by war and how they are received in the west.<br/>From 21.03.2023 12:26" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - Culture Warriors: Art in Wartime (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (21.03.2023)
