#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="382863268" tvg-name="Since Russia invaded its neighbour Ukraine‚ many are demanding cultural institutions not to programme Russian works. Is leaving out Tchaikovsky's 'Swan Lake' or Chekhov's 'Three Sisters' already a form of cancel culture? <br/>From 06.06.2023 17:40" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - Cancel Russia? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (06.06.2023)
