#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="429606858" tvg-name="In many countries‚ the state wants to control your body: the clothes you wear‚ your facial hair and for women‚ even their pregnancies. Tracks East meets Polish journalist and mixed martial-arts fighter Maja Staśko to find out the situation in Poland and the world.<br/>From 13.06.2023 13:20" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - This is my body! (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (13.06.2023)
