#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="774857821" tvg-name="Has Russia's invasion of Ukraine plunged the world back into the Cold War? And what if Russia's attack on its neighbour was actually aimed at the United States? Jean-Michel Scherbak travels to New York for Tracks East to meet Ukrainian and Russian communities there.<br/>From 09.11.2023 11:34" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Tracks East - USA-Russia A New Cold War? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.11.2023)
