#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Culture - Pop culture" tvg-id="1127293297" tvg-name="Enthusiasts present their collections of stones‚ Star Wars‚ dolls‚ axes and even bones… and their spouses are supposed to just make room! They thought they were normal‚ except if they were read the diagnosis of the DSM‚ the bible of mental health‚ they might recognise themselves. The mania for excessively accumulating objects is qualified as a disorder!<br/>From 30.01.2022 12:16" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",#AMINORMAL (6/8) - How to Live With a Hoarder (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (30.01.2022)
