#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="1916908485" tvg-name="Human beings have always dreamed of being able to fly. This dream has come true thanks to the largest wind tunnel in Europe located near Milan. Initially designed for aeronautics and aerospace‚ these indoor simulators are now open to all. A new sport has emerged thanks to these massive wind tunnels: part athlete‚ part dancer‚ and part bird‚ sportsmen and women have learned to tame the 200km winds .....<br/>From 04.11.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Geo Reportage - Flying Without Wings (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (04.11.2023)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/101000/101100/101139-018-A_SQ_0_VOEU-STE%5BANG%5D_08311005_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-101084539529015_2BcQ51Ca8Jr.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="1995855287" tvg-name="The platypus is a very strange species in a country with many unusual animals. Equipped with their characteristic beaks and thick fur‚ they are a fascinating hybrid which lay eggs  like birds or reptiles‚ and yet nurse their young like mammals. In the last few hundred years they have become increasingly endangered but new protection and resettlement schemes are ensuring a comeback.<br/>From 22.01.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",360° Reportage - Australia: Mission Platypus (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (22.01.2024)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/111000/111600/111684-024-F_SQ_0_VOEU-STE%5BANG%5D_08549813_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-101143786523426_2F9AE87rY9.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="343604180" tvg-name="Medieval combat techniques are alive and swishing in Spain. Every year‚ a big tournament takes place at the foot of the castle of Belmonte in Castile-La Mancha. Men and women dressed in armour face each other in duels‚ and fight 'battles' using swords and axes.<br/>From 16.12.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Spain: The Medieval Art of Combat - 360° Geo (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (16.12.2023)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/101000/101100/101139-024-A_SQ_0_VOEU-STE%5BANG%5D_08455001_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-101084615521056_2DjsD1KA5KX.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="378363249" tvg-name="In Europe‚ the last primary forests are found almost exclusively in the mountains in the east or south-east of the continent. These virgin forests have never been exploited or cut down‚ and have remained as they have always been. Few studies have been done on this forests‚ which are presumably havens of biodiversity. We go on a research trip to the Dinaric Alps in Albania.<br/>From 02.12.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Geo Reportage - The Green Lungs of Europe (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (02.12.2023)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/101000/101100/101139-023-A_SQ_0_VOEU-STE%5BANG%5D_08411128_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-101093622716458_2D7re1JHRnG.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="1597538160" tvg-name="Andrian is a postman in a small Siberian town on the very edge of the Russian road network. He delivers on horseback to isolated outlying areas where he is a lifeline and a friend to local residents.<br/>From 14.01.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Postman of the Taiga (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (14.01.2024)
