#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="2025538226" tvg-name="Japan is admired worldwide for its traditions and arts. From opulent fabrics to impressive wood carvings and calligraphy. But one art form has almost been forgotten: the traditional tattoo - the Horimono. Once highly popular‚ it has now become the symbol of the criminal yakuza‚ and its true history is barely known.<br/>From 21.01.2024 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Japan's Tattooed Heroes (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (21.01.2024)
