#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Lives from afar" tvg-id="1885253837" tvg-name="Rural regions of the Amazon basin in Brazil are very hard to reach and lack infrastructure and public services. To bring law and justice to remote areas‚ a floating courthouse takes to the waterways for six weeks a year.<br/>From 14.12.2023 14:11" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Amazonia - The Floating Courthouse (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (14.12.2023)
