#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Planet Earth" tvg-id="1627326774" tvg-name="The Connemara pony has been a cult animal in Ireland for generations. This robust pony breed is the centrepiece of many shows and riding competitions and is deeply associated with the wild‚ romantic and beautiful region of the Connemara on the west coast of Ireland.<br/>From 23.12.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",360° Reportage - The Connemara Pony: An Irish Legend (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (23.12.2023)
