#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Planet Earth" tvg-id="396941815" tvg-name="A journey into a unique and little-known landscape in the south of France: The Cevennes National Park‚ founded in 1970‚ is one of the largest in the country with high plateaus‚ deep gorges and extensive forests.<br/>From 05.11.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Cevennes - The Hidden South of France (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (05.11.2023)
