#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Planet Earth" tvg-id="467656665" tvg-name="In the northeast of Europe‚ Finland is nestled between Scandinavia and Russia‚ but with a very distinct identity. Its unique landscape is a patchwork of countless lakes and the deep green of its forests.<br/>From 09.12.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Journeys to the North: Finland (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.12.2023)
