#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Planet Earth" tvg-id="927536205" tvg-name="For five years now‚ rumours have been flying in the rural French region of Gevaudan. Locals have caught sight of a phantom beast and heard its calls at night in the forest. Could a puma be living in the French wilderness?<br/>From 24.11.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Puma – The New Beast of Gévaudan (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (24.11.2023)
