#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Planet Earth" tvg-id="220758653" tvg-name="Located in the North Atlantic Ocean‚ between Greenland and Norway‚ Iceland is a lush‚ volcanic island with dramatic landscapes that look too strange and beautiful to be real.<br/>From 09.12.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Journeys to the North: Iceland (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.12.2023)
