#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="201722438" tvg-name="Costa Rica is unique with an abundance of ecosystems‚ rich in flora and fauna. Thanks to a proactive and innovative ecological policy‚ it is today one of the few countries in the world to see its forest cover grow significantly year on year. This documentary is a journey into the heart of a true sanctuary of biodiversity.<br/>From 10.12.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Wild Costa Rica - A Sanctuary of Biodiversity (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (10.12.2023)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/085000/085300/085367-004-A_SQ_0_VOF-STE%5BANG%5D_08436687_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-101074293537005_2DT8X1JkwVo.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="532834544" tvg-name="Madagascar is a paradise that is home to an ecosystem full of pharmacological treasures. In a country shaped by ancestor worship‚ medicine and treatment is a complex interaction between spirits and botanicals. Bernard Fontanille‚ emergency doctor from France‚ meets a traditional healer in the village of Anantsono. With the help of the spirits‚ she invokes trances and uses the treasures of nature t.....<br/>From 09.01.2024 18:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World - Madagascar (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.01.2024)
