#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="1487869829" tvg-name="The ancestral territory of the Navajo‚ nestled in the canyons of Arizona‚ is the largest Indian tribe in the United States. Traditionally‚ the health and balance of the world‚ and that of men‚ is intertwined. Bernard Fontanille‚ a French emergency doctor‚ meets with Albert Lauhter‚ who cares for the elderly with the help of ancient songs.<br/>From 09.01.2024 18:30" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World: USA - Arizona‚ and the Nation of Medicine Men (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.01.2024)
https://arteptweb-a.akamaihd.net/am/ptweb/053000/053900/053966-017-A_SQ_0_VOF-STE%5BANG%5D_08499395_MP4-2200_AMM-PTWEB-100903987667913_2ESsf6yOYn.mp4
#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Discovery - Travel" tvg-id="1910622515" tvg-name="Siquijor is one of two thousand inhabited islands of the Philippines. Long feared for its sorcerers‚ it is now famous for its community of traditional healers. Bernard Fontanille meets with Noel Torremocha‚ a renowned healer. He follows him into a mysterious quest of ingredients that will take them deep into the forests of Siquijor.<br/>From 29.12.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Medicines of the World: The Philippines - Siquijor‚ The Healing Island (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (29.12.2023)
