#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - 20th Century" tvg-id="1440372116" tvg-name="Chilean president Salvador Allende wanted to modernise his country and fight poverty. But conservative groups organised a series of wildcat strikes and the White House put pressure on Chile's economy. When they realised that they could not eliminate the president by legal means‚ they prepared a coup d'état. This bold three-part work of cinema vérité captures the many voices of Chilean society in.....<br/>From 11.09.2023 18:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",The Battle of Chile (1/3) - The Insurrection of the Bourgeoisie (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (11.09.2023)
