#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - Civilisations" tvg-id="848972103" tvg-name="As a tattoo or worn as a pendant‚ the Hamsa or Hand of Fatima can symbolise many things. Originally from North Africa and the Middle East‚ its symbolism and religious significance varies widely.<br/>From 04.03.2022 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Making History - The Hand of Fatima: A Universal Symbol? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (04.03.2022)
