#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - Civilisations" tvg-id="1784942322" tvg-name="Part architectural genius‚ part kitsch fairytale‚ Neuschwanstein Castle is closely linked to the tragic fate of Ludwig II of Bavaria (1845-1886). The 'Mad King' poured his heart and soul into this unique construction which looks back nostalgically to the Middle Ages. A focus on the history of a building filled with dreams and legends which has become an icon of Germany around the world.<br/>From 23.12.2023 05:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Neuschwanstein Castle - King Ludwig's Dream (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (23.12.2023)
