#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - Civilisations" tvg-id="16323129" tvg-name="Peter Durand invented the tin can‚ a small but mighty innovation that changed the world. The method meant Western powers were able to feed entire armies all around the world as Europe wrestled for global dominance.<br/>From 21.02.2022 11:08" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Making History - The Tin Can: Conserve and Survive (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (21.02.2022)
