#EXTINF:-1 group-title="History - Civilisations" tvg-id="272506332" tvg-name="In the tropical colonies‚ Europeans wore a white pith helmet to protect themselves from the sun. This humble piece of headwear came to symbolise colonial oppression and reinforced the separation between coloniser and colonised.<br/>From 31.03.2022 08:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Making History - The Colonial Pith Helmet (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (31.03.2022)
