#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1064291229" tvg-name="'Time travel is just a fantasy‚' says physicist Carlo Rovelli. However‚ he also explains that time is not the rigid‚ unchanging line we intuitively imagine it to be. When Albert Einstein developed the special theory of relativity‚ he realised that time is relative and passes more slowly the faster one moves relative to another person. This opens up the possibility of travelling a few days into the.....<br/>From 09.05.2023 09:34" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - How to Time Travel (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.05.2023)
