#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="1583563281" tvg-name="From birth we are surrounded by sounds which‚ often without our knowledge‚ influence our view of the world. But are our reactions to these sounds the same?<br/>From 09.12.2021 10:39" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Do We All hear the Same Thing? - 42 - The Answer to Almost Everything (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.12.2021)
