#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - In brief" tvg-id="2115009931" tvg-name="The new space race has begun. Scientists want to know how humans can carve out a life on the moon. Could humans live there permanently? And who does the moon belong to?<br/>From 09.09.2023 08:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",42: The Answer to Almost Everything - Could We Live on the Moon? (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (09.09.2023)
