#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - Medicine and health" tvg-id="1891989006" tvg-name="Is it possible to modify our genes? Science has made major advancements‚ such as human DNA sequencing and the CRISPR/Cas9 techniques. While it has become possible to cure genetic diseases and preventively treat predispositions to certain pathologies‚ these innovations are not without risks and are likely to be misused.<br/>From 08.06.2023 16:26" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Agree to Disagree! - Gene Editing and the Spectre of Eugenics (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (08.06.2023)
