#EXTINF:-1 group-title="Sciences - Technology and innovation" tvg-id="1791117475" tvg-name="A young Neolithic hunter learns with his father how to make an axe out of wood‚ flint and bone. Everything has to be done perfectly‚ in a precise order. But today we use machines that work for us‚ obeying a specific programme. This episode examines the steps that allowed humans to discover and master algorithms.<br/>From 03.10.2023 16:00" tvg-country="Germany" tvg-language="English" channel-id="ARTE.EN",Eureka! - Algorithms: Step by Step (Originalversion mit Untertitel) (03.10.2023)
